{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Office Hero is an top-down shooter following a group of coworkers trying to defend their office against extraterrestrial invaders by shooting, getting new weapons, and shooting again. Select your office worker, put on your best weapon, and blast through stages to repel all aliens in the workspace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guns</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new guns to exterminate the invaders - and have a great day at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Workers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new workers to the fight - we all need a break sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage gets harder than the last, so don't forget to upgrade your worker and gun - don't get hit, or you'll need insurance to cover the damage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3048290?t=1744063683","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3048290?t=1744063683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744063683","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744063683","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Office Hero is an top-down shooter following a group of coworkers trying to defend their office against extraterrestrial invaders by shooting, getting new weapons, and shooting again. Select your office worker, put on your best weapon, and blast th